      "sourceText": "[clear] Translate the two point four trillion number. [whispering] Here is the trick: Qwen three point eight Max is a Mixture-of-Experts model. Total parameters describe the full expert pool; every token does not activate every parameter. A router selects experts per token. So the model can offer enormous capacity without behaving like a dense two point four trillion model on every step.",
