      "sourceText": "[enthusiastic] Hybrid thinking is a control knob. QwenCloud lets you enable or disable reasoning per request. Disable it for extraction or fast drafting. Enable it for planning, code, tool orchestration, or hard math. The guide lists low, medium, and x-high reasoning effort, with x-high as the default. More thinking means more budget, not automatically more value. [laughing] Big model, same old caveat.",
