      "hash": "f0505d70fe3ced07d629bde180cba7b8c394bb05798fa2efb796a5fee60cac96",
      "sourceText": "[serious] The limits matter. A million-token window can raise cost and latency. Multimodal inputs add new failure points, where the image or video pipeline can fail before language quality does. And significant improvement still needs independent tests on your workload. The honest status today is promising release, incomplete public evidence.",
